        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Publications: Vintage Life, InStyle\n- People: Rachel Egglestone-Evans\n- Companies: Dragoon Publishing, Time Inc.\n- Places: United Kingdom, United States, Congleton, Cheshire, England\n- Topics: Fashion magazines, lifestyle magazines, vintage fashion\n\nFacts:\n- In 1994, InStyle was founded as a monthly women’s fashion magazine in the United States, published by Time Inc.\n- Rachel \"Rae\" Evans was born on 6 September 1980 in Congleton, Cheshire, England.\n- Vintage Life is a British glossy fashion and lifestyle magazine published by Dragoon Publishing.\n- Vintage Life focuses on vintage fashion and lifestyle from the 1920s to the 1970s.\n- Rachel Egglestone-Evans is the editor of Vintage Life Magazine.\n- Rachel Egglestone-Evans is associated with a British publication focused on vintage fashion and lifestyle from the 1920s to the 1970s.",
